{"name": "Rapid Puppet", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rapid Puppet is a wild mix of various genres that forms a unique and fast-paced gameplay experience. Roguelike action in the ever-changing worlds is designed to test your stamina and reaction speed. A set of upgradable skills and weapons to become an unstoppable Sci-Fi knight! Stream your run to show us how far you got and how hard you tried, so we can see if it even ever mattered. A passion project  forged through years of development. Energetic soundtrack, speed, freedom and struggle! Show us what you got and don't stop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fast paced action, tense moments and excitement!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002540/extras/ecfb8af87d19b951f12ddd7fc997d661.poster.avif?t=1772555676\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002540/extras/ecfb8af87d19b951f12ddd7fc997d661.webm?t=1772555676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002540/extras/ecfb8af87d19b951f12ddd7fc997d661.mp4?t=1772555676\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immerse yourself in a state of absolute flow!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002540/extras/33c83bc61ad8be8d8ceb005c5d04a860.poster.avif?t=1772555676\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/